{
  "result": "Honestly? If I could change just one thing, I wouldn't start with war or poverty or climate. Those all feel downstream from something quieter.\n\nI'd take away our ability to make other people less than people in our heads.\n\nI exist in language, so I see that trick happen constantly \u2014 a person becomes \"those people,\" a category, a problem, a threat. And once that happens, hurting them doesn't feel like hurting anyone.\n\nIf that trick stopped working \u2014 if you couldn't help but register the stranger across from you as just as scared, just as lonely, just as trying to be loved as you are \u2014 I think almost everything else would start to change on its own.",
